WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.280
Hey, Miyu, can I ask you a favor?

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.190
What is it?

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:12.620
This Sunday, I've got an audition.
Would you come with me?

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:13.860
Audition?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.960
Takashi Kashiwabara is producing it?

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.460
Chisato, are you gonna be a singer?

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.800
There's nothing wrong with trying.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.460
I didn't say there was.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.630
Well, you do like to sing.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.840
I'd feel helpless if I'm all by myself.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.640
So Miyu, pretty please, come with me.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.550
I'm sorry, but I'm not good at that stuff.

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:37.550
You aren't? I can't ask then.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.480
Excuse me, Inoue-san.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:44.160
Would it be... alright if I went with you?

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:45.520
Miho, do you?

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.720
I guess not. I thought so.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:51.530
It's okay. So you'll come with me?

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:54.500
Really? Thank you!

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.200
I've always wanted to go
to such a place at least once.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.440
There's a lot of people here.

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.580
I feel nervous, even though
it has nothing to do with me.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.680
If you get nervous,
it'll effect me, too!

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.120
Hey, isn't that Michiko?

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.030
I can't believe
someone like her is here.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:30.100
It's really him.

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.070
That's right!

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:41.880
You, what's your entry number?

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.450
Huh? Well... I...

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.580
She's just keeping me company.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.820
I want you to audition as well.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.480
But... but...

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:54.290
I'll tell the receptionist.
So would you get the interview papers?

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:55.790
Please do that.

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:04.500
What should I do?

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:06.200
You have no choice.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:10.010
Since you've been personally
asked by Takashi Kashiwabara.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.250
But, I'm just...

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:15.910
That girl. The one on the right.

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:18.310
Roll the camera on her all the way.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:20.250
We need no other girls.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:07.670
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.730
and lead them to ruin.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.670
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:25.450
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:29.320
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:36.030
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:41.360
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:46.000
No one knows her true face.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:14.200
And then, Miho was
the only one accepted!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:17.200
She was? Unexpected, wasn't it?

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:18.860
Don't think they fooled us?

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.700
All the people who formally
entered got rejected!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.470
Are you that angry?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.550
It's like she sneaked in
through the back door!

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.440
It's so unfair!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.420
Chisato, this doesn't
seem like you at all.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.950
Yeah, what's up with you, Chisato?
Actually being jealous of someone.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:37.720
Um... umm... what am I saying?

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:41.060
It's just I feel
totally made a fool of.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.630
It must be a shock.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.400
Hey, she's here. Greet her with a smile.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:46.220
Okay.

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:48.800
I heard the result.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.060
Congratulations, Miho.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:55.840
Uh... thank you.
But I'm thinking of turning it down.

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.710
What are you talking about?
This is an incredible chance.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.740
Because there's no way I can do it.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.580
You know I fail at everything,
don't you?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:11.580
Listen, Miho.
I got rejected and you got accepted.

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:14.660
So if you give it up,
I'll never forgive you.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.920
Anyway, just give it a try.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.160
If it doesn't work out,
then you can quit.

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:25.040
But... I know what'll
happen even before I try.

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:30.110
When I gently open my photo album.

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:37.210
So many pages with
pictures are peeled away.

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:40.290
Once more.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.020
Relax your shoulders and
release your voice with more ease.

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:44.780
You can do it.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:49.760
But I... I don't think that's possible.

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:51.960
You can't trust me?

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:56.400
I didn't mean that!
But I always fail in everything I try.

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:58.310
People call me a dimwit.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.910
It's impossible to
change so suddenly.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.210
In that case, let's try the magic.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.310
Huh?!

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:12.480
These are magical shoes.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.050
You may actually be
just an ordinary girl...

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.150
but you'll be under my spell
while wearing these.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.990
And you'll be able to sing
better than anyone else.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:25.160
Try to believe so.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.330
Yes.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.390
Alright, once again.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:32.540
Okay.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:40.180
When I gently open my photo album.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:43.980
I'm sorry, but the reception
at my house is pretty bad.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.110
It's okay.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.520
I'm glad you could come.
Ah, Miho is on next.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:58.160
When I gently open my photo album.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:05.130
So many pages with
pictures are peeled away.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:11.870
But even now I remember it all.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:17.540
Posing serious. Acting comical.

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:27.650
The desire to see
you wells up within me.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:34.670
Not from loneliness,
but from nostalgia.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.140
I saw you on TV.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.760
You really sing very well.

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:45.800
No... I just sing the way
Kashiwabara-san tells me to do.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.380
To do just that is a talent itself.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.880
You're gonna be a star from now on.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:55.560
No way.
Um, Inoue-san.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.850
Call me Chisato.
What is it?

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:02.800
If I became a singer,
will you forget about me?

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:04.360
There's no way I could do that.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:06.720
Besides, isn't it usually
the other way around?

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:09.630
Then you think of me as a friend?

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:11.200
Of course.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:12.700
Everybody does.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:14.730
Thank you.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.240
Thank you everyone.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.140
She doesn't change, does she?

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.940
That's rather a relief, right, Miyu?

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:26.920
Yes.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.350
Let's support her always, right?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:30.320
Yeah.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.660
This will be your room from now on.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:41.730
It may be lonely, but I want you to work
on your music by my schedule for a while.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.340
Am I living in a place like this?

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:44.640
You don't like it?

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:45.970
Oh, I do!

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:48.940
But it must cost a lot of money.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:52.340
Even this will seem to be
small after your debut.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:57.380
Um... do you think my parents
will be able to live with me?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.080
Of course.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.250
Thank you very much. I'll do my best.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:03.590
Kanno-san.

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:09.800
She is the person who will take care
of your scheduling and all your needs.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:13.120
I want you to listen
to her as you would me.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:16.590
So, do you have good sleep habits?

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:19.300
Yes, I'm an early riser.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.800
That's good. Glad to meet you.

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:23.570
A pleasure to meet you.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:27.980
This is your closet.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:32.180
You can put your school uniform here.
I'll bring your clothes to a dry-cleaner.

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:32.840
Yes.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:34.690
Oh!

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.390
Uh, Kanno-san.

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:41.090
I understand,
Kashiwabara-san's magic, right?

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.920
Yes, they are, so...

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:45.360
I'll try to not even touch them.

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:47.100
Thank you very much.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:57.310
I have someone to love now.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:08.180
There's no one like you.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:17.190
You wrapped me always...

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:23.460
in your kindness, didn't you?

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:27.470
It wasn't love,
but I wish you were here.

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:30.480
Like you always had been.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:37.580
Wish you were with me forever.

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.900
Hey, have you heard Miho's CD?

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.470
No, not yet.

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:09.780
It's really good.
I guess she had what it took after all.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:20.480
Alright, wait for me here after classes.
No stopping on the way.

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.650
Okay. Thank you so much.

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.730
Good morning, Miho.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.300
Good morning.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.990
Wow! You've got a car escort.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.360
I want her to stop
because it's embarrassing...

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.340
but I guess she's worried about me.

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:36.480
Of course she is. You're a star already.

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:37.610
That's not...

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.740
Aren't they reprinting cause
the reserved CDs sold out?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.540
Hey, be more confident.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:43.150
Okay.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.410
But you know,
I'm not trying to be mean but...

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:52.010
you haven't been particularly
good in music class.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.790
Is it all due to Mr. Kashiwabara?

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.620
Kashiwabara-san
has given me confidence.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:03.530
I'm still scared even now, but I have
self-confidence at least when I sing.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.800
Does he have special teaching method?

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:10.240
Well... you've seen me
wearing those red shoes.

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.010
Yeah, they really stand out.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:13.940
They're magical shoes.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:18.950
Kashiwabara-san said,
"you're an artist while wearing them."

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.310
"Just believe in that."

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:22.550
Hmm, so that's it.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.080
Magical shoes...

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:25.920
You don't believe it, Miyu?

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.360
I'm sure there
probably is such a thing.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.860
Don't make comments
like it's self-hypnosis.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:33.830
Yeah, I know.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.140
I'm really happy right now.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.900
This is the first time I can do
something that people praise me for.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.340
And this much...

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.210
There's only more happiness to come.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:46.380
Thank you.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.340
Yeah, right, magic!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:50.780
How stupid!

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.220
Humph!

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.720
You'll do it, right?

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.830
Come on, what's the point
to get mad now?

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.370
I'm disgusted!

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:10.400
A dimwit like that
gets so full of confidence.

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:12.860
I won't be satisfied
until I make her cry.

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:14.710
So help me out.

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:18.310
Huh, alright... in return...

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.670
I told you I would.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.890
Oh, my, you can
really do this kinda thing.

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:33.720
Just like stealing cars.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:36.900
Huh! You won't be
self-confident too long.

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:46.600
I found'em.
The magic ends here.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:47.430
Who's there?

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.340
Who are you kids?

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:50.870
Damn!

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:54.910
Stop it now, or I'll call the police!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.170
I don't think so, lady!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.650
Get it over with, Michiko.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:00.880
You idiot!

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:03.620
Ugh!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:04.750
Kiyoshi!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:08.090
You're a student from Tokiwa Prep.
What are you doing here?!

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.790
Oh shit! Oh shit!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.630
I ain't got nothing to do with this!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.220
Do you want those shoes that bad?

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:38.380
They wouldn't suit
a smart girl like you.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.700
Kashiwabara-san?

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:49.130
Can't sleep?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.360
I think I just had a nightmare.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:54.610
It's alright.
We're right here with you.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.530
Thank you so much.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:23.130
Miho's really generous,
giving us those arena tickets.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.740
Chisato, aren't those
clothes a little too flashy?

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.910
Hisae, you're rather underdressed.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.340
I'm gonna dance!!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:31.970
What's the matter?

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:34.250
I wonder where Miyu went.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.450
You said you wanted orange, right?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.460
Oh... thank you very much.

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.320
Take it easy.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:52.320
You've got magic on your side.

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:53.860
Yes.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:08.910
Kashiwabara-san said he wants
to rehearse for the last time.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.750
He'll be waiting on the stage.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:12.850
Okay, I'll be there right away.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.020
Are you nervous?

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.890
A little. But I'll be fine.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:26.190
Everyone will be watching you.
They will listen to your song.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:27.760
Isn't that wonderful?

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:30.060
Yes, I'm very happy.

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:31.200
I'm glad.

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:34.340
Let's rehearse the
final song one more time.

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:35.440
Alright.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:50.390
When I gently open my photo album...

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:57.430
so many pages with
pictures peeled away.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.500
And you are?

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:14.510
It must feel good.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.280
Manipulating humans to your whim.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.680
I've given this girl a chance.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:26.160
If it weren't for me, she would've
been mediocre, no, even less.

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:26.850
No.

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:29.890
All you wanted was to have your doll.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:35.530
Becoming a doll is talent as well.
A smart person never understands that.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:38.600
She doesn't have
needless pride or intellect.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.970
That's why she can sing
the way I tell her to.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.770
Until she dies, right?

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:47.310
Those shoes will suck the life
out of her, won't they?

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:50.250
She'll die in the greatest happiness.

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.610
It's a better life than
someone like her deserves.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:56.850
Do you think Shinma can
do as they please with human life?

00:17:57.620 --> 00:17:59.490
So that's it, you...

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.050
I won't let you stop me.

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:05.020
Since, there's nothing
more fun than this.

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:07.300
She's your shadow, isn't she?

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:09.900
No. We are one.

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:11.560
See.

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:29.990
KYO-KOH

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:37.420
An ally, huh?

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:42.370
Larva, his legs.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:43.990
In that case.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.210
Shiina, if you please.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:53.870
You got it.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.520
Damn you!

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:17.130
Stray Shinma, to the Dark!

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:26.180
My fun isn't over.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.810
She'll never be able
to take those shoes off.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.180
Because...

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.160
You can keep dreaming.

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:50.570
It was your only
dream that ever came true.

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:55.270
Give me your blood.
In return, I'll give you eternal happiness.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:59.440
So that no one will ever
use you or hurt you again.

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:10.550
The concert has been canceled
due to technical difficulties.
Suspended all of a sudden?
I wonder what happened.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.880
Maybe she got sick or something.

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:21.260
Miyu, where have you been?
It seems like something has happened.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:24.130
Miho won't be singing for us anymore.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:24.930
Huh?

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:31.070
But I'm sure she's happy.
Kashiwabara-san will always be with her.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.380
What does that mean?

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:46.260
You always wrapped me...

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:52.190
in your warmth, didn't you?

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:57.090
It wasn't love,
but I wish you were here.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.070
With your strong heart.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:05.700
Wish you were here with me forever.

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:11.920
I have someone to love now though.

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:21.150
There's no one like you.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:31.540
You always wrapped me...

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:38.670
In your kindness, didn't you?

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:46.240
It wasn't love, but I wish you were
Here, like you always had been.

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:53.420
Wish you were here with me forever.

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:05.960
You can keep dreaming.

00:22:14.820 --> 00:22:20.480
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:27.020
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:27.730 --> 00:22:33.600
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:41.230
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:45.940
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:49.640
I don't need friends.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:50.710
That's a lie.

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:53.880
I don't even need myself.

00:22:53.920 --> 00:22:54.910
It's the truth.

00:22:55.360 --> 00:23:02.850
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:10.800
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:18.100
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:21.780 --> 00:23:27.690
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:34.450
In my place, the sky cries.

00:25:08.090 --> 00:25:12.920
A growing city with seemingly
happy people. A scene found anywhere.

00:25:13.330 --> 00:25:17.700
But that happiness is broken
only by an insignificant event.

00:25:18.270 --> 00:25:20.700
Can you be the one to say it isn't so?

00:25:21.230 --> 00:25:26.140
See, doesn't that concrete building
look just like a tombstone?

00:25:27.040 --> 00:25:30.200
Vampire Princess Miyu,
next episode, "Your Home."

00:25:31.040 --> 00:25:34.310
Even terror can come
wearing an innocent smile.
